<div class="modal-content">
  <button class="modal-close" @click="$refs.helpDialog.close()" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>

  <h2>Kanji Detail Quick Reference</h2>

  <h3>Video Controls</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Click video to switch to typeface view</li>
    <li>Click typeface to switch back to video</li>
    <li>Use controls to play, pause, or step through strokes</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Stroke Breakdown</h3>
  <p>Hover over individual stroke images at the bottom to jump to that point in the animation.</p>

  <h3>Examples</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Hover over examples to see English translation</li>
    <li>Click play button to hear pronunciation</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Radical Animation</h3>
  <p>Click the radical highlight area to see how the radical appears within the kanji.</p>

  <h3>Keyboard Shortcuts</h3>
  <table class="help-table">
    <tr><td><kbd>Space</kbd></td><td>Play/Pause video</td></tr>
    <tr><td><kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>&larr;</kbd></td><td>Previous stroke</td></tr>
    <tr><td><kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>&rarr;</kbd></td><td>Next stroke</td></tr>
  </table>

  <p class="help-footer">
    <a href="https://kanjialive.com/user-guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Full User Guide</a>
  </p>
</div>
